 ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
      Bulletins.opt (Command Definitions)
      ~~~~~~~~~~~~~
      Define Bulletins & Commands in bulletins area.


      BadDownloads.opt
      ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
      For filenames that you don't want anyone to ever download like:
